{"text": "She said that she would dance with me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I brought her red roses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Cried the young Student. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But in all my garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is no red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lay on the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And his beautiful eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Filled with tears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because I have no red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My life is sad and empty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From her nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the oak tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Nightingale heard him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And wondered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was a small brown bird. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who sang every night in the garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Here at last is a true lover. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Nightingale. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Night after night I have sung of him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Though I did not know him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now I see him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And his face is as pale as ivory. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Student said that the Prince was giving a ball. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And his love would be there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I bring her a red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She will dance with me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Until dawn.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "f", " ", "I", " ", "b", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", 